        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2012 Wiley Periodicals, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "A 42-year-old male was admitted with persistent atypical chest pain following a motorcycle accident six months previously. A pseudoaneurysm, diagnosed by transthoracic echocardiography and computed tomography, was excised and the right coronary artery underwent bypass grafting."
